  "body_html": "<h1>Strategy Profile</h1>\n<p>Given a strategic game \\((I, (S_i), (u_i))\\), a strategy profile is a tuple\n\\(\\sigma = (\\sigma_i)_{i \\in I}\\) where \\(\\sigma_i \\in S_i\\) for each player \\(i\\).</p>\n<p>In Lean, a profile is <code>∀ i, G.strategy i</code>.</p>",
